  <tag k="inscription" v="Memorial to Adolf Erik Nordenskiöld (1832-1901), a Finnish scientist, an explorer and the first to sail the North-East Passage from the Arctic Sea to the Pacific Ocean. Sculpture by Eric Adlercreutz, Heikki Häiväoja and Johanna Häiväoja, 1985."/>
